products.product_description:
THRIVE 6 Grain Pancake Mix; There are two unit sizes: (1) 4 lb. #10/gallon can (6.03x 7.02
) (the "Gallon Cans"); and (2) 1.17 lb. Pull-Top Pantry Cans (4.01x 5.08
) (the "Pantry Cans"). Both units are packaged in metal cans. The Pantry Can has a metal pull-top lid and the Gallon Can has a metal lid that must be opened by a can opener. (1) The Gallon Cans may be ordered as single units or in six (6) can cases. (2) The Pantry Cans may be ordered as single units or in ten (10) can cases.
